OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 21 MAY
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GJas Kayser, in for Soweto Kinch,
OL,12,     Gpresents another hour of the best
OL,13,     Gin jazz, and Louis Hayes returns
OL,14,     Gwith his fourth selection of the
OL,15,     Gweek.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GRok Zaletel Cernos joins the RTV
OL,18,     GSlovenia Symphony Orchestra and
OL,19,     Gconductor Catherine Larsen-
OL,20,     GMaguire in Mendelssohn's Violin
OL,21,     GConcerto, followed by
OL,22,     GTchaikovsky's Fifth Symphony.
